<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0B1521', padding: 60 }}>
  <Box style={{ position: 'relative', width: '100%', height: '100%', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 40 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 350, height: '100%', background: '#132B45', borderRadius: 8, padding: 34, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
      <Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 5, height: 20, background: '#63A7D4' }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FBCE4', letterSpacing: 2 }}>本 PPT 的资料来源</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 110, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#63A7D4', lineHeight: 1, marginTop: 40 }}>651</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 6 }}>段公开视频文稿</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#A9CFE7', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>访谈 · 发布会 · 股东大会<br />1998 — 2026，一个可检索的中文库</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 5, height: 20, background: '#63A7D4' }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FBCE4', letterSpacing: 2 }}>数据概览</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', marginTop: 14, lineHeight: 1.2 }}>一个名字，贯穿十年技术转向</Text>
      <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#3A4653', marginTop: 20 }} />
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, marginTop: 26 }}>
        {[
          { k: '588', u: '份', d: '英文逐字文稿', c: '#63A7D4' },
          { k: '21', u: '篇', d: '中文深度精读', c: '#8FBCE4' },
          { k: '11', u: '年', d: '2015 → 2026', c: '#8ED1A8' },
        ].map((it, i) => (
          <Box key={i} style={{ flex: 1, background: '#162534', borderRadius: 8, padding: 22, border: '1px solid #26384C' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 4 }}>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 52, fontWeight: 'bold', color: it.c, lineHeight: 1 }}>{it.k}</Text>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#A9CFE7', paddingBottom: 6 }}>{it.u}</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#E7E8E9', marginTop: 14 }}>{it.d}</Text>
          </Box>
        ))}
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ marginTop: 26, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
        {[
          '2015 GTC：黄仁勋把马斯克请上台，两个人对赌自动驾驶与算力',
          '2025 美沙论坛：三人同台，把问题推向电力、散热与 AI 泡沫',
          '贯穿其间：马斯克在股东大会、全员会、播客里反复提到这个人',
        ].map((t, i) => (
          <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#63A7D4', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>—</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E7E8E9', lineHeight: 1.55, flex: 1 }}>{t}</Text>
          </Box>
        ))}
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', background: '#63A7D4', borderRadius: 6, padding: 16, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#08131F' }}>结论：</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#08131F' }}>黄仁勋这个名字，出现在马斯克每一次关键的技术表态里。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
